{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/RunYourOwnBookshop.png?t=1743027487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fulfill your dream of owning and operating your own bookshop. Buy and sell inventory and use the profits to decorate and expand your shop. Build your business from a small boutique shop into a retail empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/Bookshop_SteamGIF_03.gif?t=1743027487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/StockAndSellProducts.png?t=1743027487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy and place bookshelves, then fill them with new books, comics, and other items to sell. Run the cash register to earn revenue. As your business grows, hire employees to be cashiers and item stockers so you can focus on expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/Bookshop_SteamGIF_01.gif?t=1743027487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/Bookshop_SteamGIF_02.gif?t=1743027487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/SetTheVibes.png?t=1743027487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your profits to customize your store. Choose walls and floors. Decorate with rugs, plants, wall art, and more! Create specialized sections for your favorite genre, or build cozy book nooks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/Bookshop_SteamGIF_04.gif?t=1743027487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/GetPowerfulAbilitiesFromRareBooks.png?t=1743027487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get boxes of used books that may contain rare mythical books. These books have powerful abilities to improve your profits and capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/Bookshop_SteamGIF_05.gif?t=1743027487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/AdoptAShopCat.png?t=1743027487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adopt a cat to keep you and your customers company every day in the shop. Buy food, a bed, and other items to keep the cat active and happy in the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/Bookshop_SteamGIF_06.gif?t=1743027487\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3467040?t=1743027487","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/8cb4a2b44aab2d76654d63e38f0596ed6b602453/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743027487","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/29039b83063e2b597b09feddafb40b81da2f5416/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743027487","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/29039b83063e2b597b09feddafb40b81da2f5416/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743027487","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/RunYourOwnBookshop.png?t=1743027487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fulfill your dream of owning and operating your own bookshop. Buy and sell inventory and use the profits to decorate and expand your shop. Build your business from a small boutique shop into a retail empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/Bookshop_SteamGIF_03.gif?t=1743027487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/StockAndSellProducts.png?t=1743027487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy and place bookshelves, then fill them with new books, comics, and other items to sell. Run the cash register to earn revenue. As your business grows, hire employees to be cashiers and item stockers so you can focus on expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/Bookshop_SteamGIF_01.gif?t=1743027487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/Bookshop_SteamGIF_02.gif?t=1743027487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/SetTheVibes.png?t=1743027487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your profits to customize your store. Choose walls and floors. Decorate with rugs, plants, wall art, and more! Create specialized sections for your favorite genre, or build cozy book nooks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as